2. **Equivalent Resistance in Series ($R_s$)**:
Current remains constant through each resistor:
\`\`\`PowerShell
V = V1 + V2 + V3
I*Rs = I*R1 + I*R2 + I*R3
Rs = R1 + R2 + R3
\`\`\`

